   "id": "letter-combinations",
   "num": 3,
   "leet_id": 17,
   "title_cn": "电话号码的字母组合",
   "title_en": "Letter Combinations of a Phone Number",
   "difficulty": "中等",
   "category": "backtracking",
   "tags": [
    "哈希表",
    "字符串",
    "回溯"
   ],
   "statement": {
    "desc": [
     "给定一个仅包含数字 `2-9` 的字符串，返回所有它能表示的字母组合。数字到字母的映射与电话九宫格一致（2→abc, 3→def … 9→wxyz）。答案按任意顺序返回。"
    ],
    "examples": [
     {
      "input": "digits = \"23\"",
      "output": "[\"ad\",\"ae\",\"af\",\"bd\",\"be\",\"bf\",\"cd\",\"ce\",\"cf\"]"
     },
     {
      "input": "digits = \"\"",
      "output": "[]"
     }
    ],
    "constraints": [
     "0 <= digits.length <= 4",
     "digits[i] 是 ['2','9'] 的数字"
    ]
   },
   "solution": {
    "idea": [
     "这是最「纯粹」的组合回溯：第 i 位数字有若干候选字母，树的第 i 层就在这些候选里选一个。",
     "树的高度 = 数字个数，路径 root→叶 拼出一个组合；组合总数 = 各层候选数之积（如 \"23\" → 3×3 = 9）。",
     "注意空串特判：`dfs(0)` 直接进不去循环，返回空列表。"
    ],
    "steps": [
     "建立数字 → 字母串的映射表 `phone`",
     "`dfs(i)`：处理第 i 位数字，遍历其每个候选字母",
     "字母入 buf → `dfs(i+1)` → 出 buf",
     "i == len(digits) 时把 buf 拼成字符串收集"
    ],
    "complexity": {
     "time": "O(4ⁿ × n)（最坏每位 4 个候选，拼接 O(n)）",
     "space": "O(n)（递归栈 + buf）"
    },
    "code": "class Solution:\n    def letterCombinations(self, digits: str) -> List[str]:\n        if not digits:\n            return []\n        phone = {\"2\": \"abc\", \"3\": \"def\", \"4\": \"ghi\", \"5\": \"jkl\",\n                 \"6\": \"mno\", \"7\": \"pqrs\", \"8\": \"tuv\", \"9\": \"wxyz\"}\n        res, buf = [], []\n\n        def dfs(i):                      # 处理第 i 位数字\n            if i == len(digits):\n                res.append(\"\".join(buf))\n                return\n            for ch in phone[digits[i]]:  # 该位数字的每个候选字母\n                buf.append(ch)\n                dfs(i + 1)\n                buf.pop()\n\n        dfs(0)\n        return res"
   },
