   "id": "word-search",
   "num": 6,
   "leet_id": 79,
   "title_cn": "单词搜索",
   "title_en": "Word Search",
   "difficulty": "中等",
   "category": "backtracking",
   "tags": [
    "数组",
    "字符串",
    "回溯",
    "矩阵"
   ],
   "statement": {
    "desc": [
     "给定 `m x n` 网格 `board` 和字符串 `word`，判断 `word` 是否存在于网格中。单词必须按照字母顺序，通过**上下左右**相邻的单元格内的字母构成，同一个单元格内的字母**不允许被重复使用**。"
    ],
    "examples": [
     {
      "input": "board = [[\"A\",\"B\",\"C\",\"E\"],[\"S\",\"F\",\"C\",\"S\"],[\"A\",\"D\",\"E\",\"E\"]], word = \"ABCCED\"",
      "output": "true"
     },
     {
      "input": "board = [[\"A\",\"B\",\"C\",\"E\"],[\"S\",\"F\",\"C\",\"S\"],[\"A\",\"D\",\"E\",\"E\"]], word = \"ABCB\"",
      "output": "false"
     }
    ],
    "constraints": [
     "m == board.length, n == board[i].length",
     "1 <= m, n <= 6",
     "1 <= word.length <= 15",
     "board 和 word 仅由大小写英文字母组成"
    ]
   },
   "solution": {
    "idea": [
     "网格 DFS 模板题：从每个格子尝试作为起点，一路向四邻匹配 `word[i+1]`，走不通就回溯。",
     "**标记已访问**是关键——直接把当前格改写为 `#`（或任何非字母哨兵），递归返回时还原。原地标记省掉 visited 数组。",
     "走到 `i == len(word)` 说明全部匹配成功。四方向递归用 `or` 短路：一条路通了就不再试其他方向。"
    ],
    "steps": [
     "遍历所有格子作为起点，调用 `dfs(r, c, 0)`",
     "`dfs`：越界或 `board[r][c] != word[i]` → False",
     "i 是最后一个字符 → True",
     "标记 `board[r][c] = '#'` → 四方向 `or` 递归 → 还原字符（回溯）"
    ],
    "complexity": {
     "time": "O(m × n × 3^L)（L 为单词长，每步最多 3 个新方向）",
     "space": "O(L)（递归栈）"
    },
    "code": "class Solution:\n    def exist(self, board: List[List[str]], word: str) -> bool:\n        m, n = len(board), len(board[0])\n\n        def dfs(r, c, i):\n            if i == len(word):           # 全部匹配\n                return True\n            if not (0 <= r < m and 0 <= c < n) or board[r][c] != word[i]:\n                return False\n            board[r][c] = \"#\"            # 标记：本条路径不许再用\n            found = (dfs(r + 1, c, i + 1) or dfs(r - 1, c, i + 1)\n                     or dfs(r, c + 1, i + 1) or dfs(r, c - 1, i + 1))\n            board[r][c] = word[i]        # 回溯：还原现场\n            return found\n\n        for r in range(m):\n            for c in range(n):\n                if dfs(r, c, 0):\n                    return True\n        return False"
   },
